<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/7/eng@/~cl_7> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 37 of the principal Act is amended in subsection (2) by substituting for the words “two years” the words “five years”."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/7/eng@> .
