<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/7/eng@/~cl_8> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 42 of the principal Act is amended in subsections (1) and (2), by substituting for the words “Prime Minister” the word “Council”. New sections 42a and 42b"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2020/7/eng@> .
